        "text": "Introduction section 'What this handbook covers' (page 3) describing the handbook's scope, prerequisites (prior supply chain process and maturity assessments and supply chain design), five applicable country scenarios, and Fig. 3 illustrating the digital health supply chain ecosystem from transactional systems to collaborative processes and end-to-end visibility.",
