      "narrative": null,
      "content": "INTRODUCTION\nIMPLEMENTATION\nSTRATEGY\nTRACEABILITY\nARCHITECTURE\nANNEXES\nCOUNTRY EXAMPLES\nHow to use this handbook\nThis handbook provides a stepwise approach to digitalizing \nthe health supply chain, as depicted in Fig. 4.\n\t\n→Chapter 1 provides guidance on defining a holistic \nvision, strategic goals and objectives for a DHSC \nthat aligns with the country’s strategic priorities for \ninformation technology (IT) and digital health.\n\t\n→Chapter 2 outlines approaches to defining the DHSC \narchitecture, which will serve as the blueprint for the \nvarious supply chain system interventions.\n\t\n→Chapter 3",
